{"title":"Career roadmap · UI Developer","role":"UI Developer","summary":"A UI Developer builds the visual and interactive layer of websites and applications. The role combines HTML, CSS, JavaScript, responsive design, accessibility, UI component development and frontend engineering.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Mobile App / Web / Game Development","Timeline assumption":"3-year BCA beginning in 2026 → graduation around 2029. For a 4-year honours structure, graduation would typically be around 2030."},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Direct"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA student, this is a direct and practical career path, especially when the degree is supported by a strong portfolio and frontend development skills."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","HTML/CSS/JavaScript","UI projects","React/TypeScript","Internship","UI Developer","Frontend Developer","Senior Frontend Engineer","Lead/Staff Engineer"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2029/30"},{"text":"Master web fundamentals, responsive UI, JavaScript, React, accessibility and frontend tooling."}],[{"text":"2029–2034"},{"text":"Become a production frontend developer and learn APIs, testing, performance and design systems."}],[{"text":"2034–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Frontend Engineer, UI Engineer, Design Systems Engineer or Frontend Lead."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Staff/Principal Frontend Engineer, UI Architect, Engineering Manager or design-technology leadership."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"HTML + CSS"},{"text":"Web fundamentals"},{"text":"Responsive webpages"},{"text":"UI foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"DOM, events, APIs"},{"text":"Interactive applications"},{"text":"Programming"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"React"},{"text":"Components, state, routing"},{"text":"React application"},{"text":"Frontend capability"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"TypeScript + APIs"},{"text":"Type safety, REST"},{"text":"Full frontend app"},{"text":"Engineering depth"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced UI"},{"text":"Accessibility, performance, testing"},{"text":"Production-style application"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship + deployment"},{"text":"Git, CI/CD, cloud"},{"text":"Live application"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced frontend"},{"text":"Design systems, architecture"},{"text":"Component library"},{"text":"Specialisation"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Capstone"},{"text":"Full-stack integration"},{"text":"Final portfolio + placement"},{"text":"Career readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to prioritise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Web Technologies"},{"text":"HTML/CSS"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"Object-Oriented Programming"},{"text":"Data Structures"},{"text":"Database Management"},{"text":"Computer Networks"},{"text":"Software Engineering"},{"text":"UI/UX Fundamentals"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Web Accessibility"},{"text":"Mobile Application Development"},{"text":"Computer Graphics"},{"text":"Software Testing"},{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Information Security"},{"text":"API Development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Web fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML5"},{"text":"CSS3"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"CSS Grid/Flexbox"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Browser DevTools"}]},{"type":